<title>USA: Lands' End in licensing pact with MontBell.</title>
<headline>Lands' End in licensing pact with MontBell.</headline>
<dateline>DODGEVILLE, Wis. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lands' End Inc said Friday it entered into a licensing agreement with Japanese outdoor clothing and equipment maker MontBell Co Ltd of Osaka.</p>
<p>Lands' End gets exclusive rights to use the MontBell trademark in the United States, Canada, Mexico and Europe.</p>
<p>Under the agreement,  Lands' End will manufacture and sell MontBell product as a separate line in its regular monthly catalog.</p>
<p>Lands' End had a prior licensing agreement with MontBell (Japan) from July 1994 to January 19896, through its then wholly-owned subsidiary MontBell America Inc.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
